Provenance: The answer key ran in the October 1933 issue, page 22 ('Solution of Puzzle No. 294', https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1933-10_105/page/n25/mode/1up), at the page's outer edge. The harvest didn't match it; the key here is read from the scan.


